Package: adnexpexa
Title: ADNEX Model for Adnexal Masses - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ben", "Van Calster", role = "ctb",
           comment = "First author of ADNEX"))
Description: Implements the published equations of the IOTA ADNEX model
    (Van Calster et al., BMJ 2014 <doi:10.1136/bmj.g5920>), which estimates,
    before surgery, the probabilities that an adnexal mass is benign,
    borderline, stage I invasive, stage II-IV invasive or secondary metastatic,
    and the total risk of malignancy. The version with CA-125 uses appendix D
    of the 2014 paper; the separately fitted version without CA-125 uses
    appendix 4 of Van Calster et al., BMJ 2020 <doi:10.1136/bmj.m2614>. This
    is not the certified IOTA/Gynaia ADNEX application.
